Latest commit: feat(chat_backend): display "Zero Equipment" for Ability Formulas category

Add a client-only displayName getter on ProgramCategory that remaps the
legacy "Ability Formulas" name to "Zero Equipment", and use it in the
published category name list. Lets us update the user-visible label
without changing Firestore source data until enough users are on the
latest app version.

