Latest commit: add human testing harness + first testable: Use this workout

Builds out the human-testable system:
- human_testable.json (repo root, symlinked into client_app/assets/)
- /create-testable and /sync-testables slash commands + sync script
- showWhatTesting toggle on MoonSettings + Settings UI
- Floating banner + testing panel UI in client_app, gated on the flag
- Firestore rules for humanTestCompletions (staff-only)

First user-facing testable: from a program, opening the calendar shows
'Use this workout' instead of 'Paste workout' on an empty day, and tapping
it pastes the workout AND opens the workout playback screen so you can
do it immediately.

