Latest commit: move testing banner into DevOverlay, gated only on showWhatTesting

The banner now lives inside the dev overlay area and renders for any
user with showWhatTesting=true, regardless of dev role. Always shows
when on (displays 'All tested' when 0 pending) so it's a clear status
of the testing harness.

DevOverlay accepts a TestingBannerBuilder so atg_ui doesn't depend on
client_app code; app.dart wires the builder on init.

