Latest commit: fix(testing): record Passed/Failed via controller, surface write errors, show history

- TestableController.markPassed/markFailed write Firestore with try/catch;
  errors land in TestableProviders.lastWriteError and render as a red
  banner in the panel header so silent failures are visible.
- Each tap appends a TestAttempt to humanTestCompletions/{commitId}.attempts
  via arrayUnion (result, optional notes, by uid, at timestamp).
- TestableView exposes attempts list; UI renders 'History (N)' under each
  testable showing per-attempt result, time-ago, and notes.

