Latest commit: rename: collection 'testable', field 'humanTestResults', class HumanTestResult

Aligns naming with the user's mental model:
- Firestore collection: humanTestCompletions -> testable
- Field on doc: attempts -> humanTestResults
- Class: TestAttempt -> HumanTestResult
- Drop TestCompletion wrapper; TestableView holds list<HumanTestResult>
  directly and derives state/notes/result from the latest entry.

Rules relaxed to isSignedIn() for the testable collection so any tester
can write — gating happens client-side via showWhatTesting.

sync_testables.mjs and Firestore rules updated to match. TestingPanel
(unused full-screen variant) removed.

